      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. For a reftable backend create() wrote repositoryformatversion\u003d0 and no extensions.refStorage, so the repo reopened as RefDirectory, disagreeing with its on-disk storage. \n\nSeparately, a new repo\u0027s format is no longer taken from global config: it comes only from an explicit request (builder / init.defaultRefFormat / GIT_DEFAULT_REF_FORMAT), else files.\n\nDone.",
