      "writtenOn": "2026-10-23T12:15:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed, removed now. The enableGlobalReftable() helper is gone: tests select reftable via setRefStorageFormat(\"reftable\").\n\nextensions.refStorage is read only from an existing repo\u0027s own config, as specified in the spec.\n\nDone.",
