        "id": 1000000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-22T19:59:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t believe this is the correct expectation: if you don\u0027t explicitly ask for the `reftable` format, the default is `files` (packed-refs).\n\nThe global config of `extensions.refStorage \u003d reftable` isn\u0027t documented and isn\u0027t supported by Git or JGit so far.\n\nI believe the correct way would be to have an explicit `refFormat` parameter in the `FileRepository` object.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 52,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 53,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "57ae6f0c708014d0efe5c09e3f98018d7da18940",
